  "description": "Edge-triggered RGB channel inversion, dropout and chromatic misregistration. Symmetric four-direction contrast detection surrounds both sides of contours, including thin details. Set each Red/Green/Blue Mode to 0 Keep, 1 Shift, 2 Invert or 3 Mute. Detection Radius determines contour scale; Edge Threshold selects contrast; Edge Softness ranges from almost hard to feathered. Channel Offset and Offset Angle control RGB separation (red forward, green perpendicular, blue opposite); Tone Bias favours shadows or highlights, and Effect Mix sets overall opacity. Ideal for hard-edged graphics, architecture, type, portraits and glitch art. Original alpha is preserved.",
  "author": "ChromaMeld",
